394 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E (Event Ticket Booking with QR Code Validation is a complete web-based application designed to provide an efficient and user-friendly platform for booking and managing event tickets online. This system allows users to view available events, book tickets, and receive a unique QR code for entry verification. The application is developed using modern web technologies such as React.js for the frontend, Spring Boot for the backend, and MySQL for database management.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
395 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E (The Event Ticket Booking System automates the entire ticketing process, reducing manual work and improving accuracy. It provides a smooth and reliable experience for both users and event organizers. By using this system, events can be managed more efficiently, customer experience is enhanced, and ticket validation becomes faster and more secure.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E (This project demonstrates the effective use of full-stack web development to build a real world application that supports online booking, digital tickets, and secure event management.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
398 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 286 0 R
/E (In addition, the system is designed with a modern and responsive user interface, making it accessible on both desktop and mobile devices. The application ensures fast communication between the frontend and backend through RESTful APIs, providing real-time updates for ticket booking and validation. Proper authentication and role-based access control are implemented to maintain data security between users and administrators. Overall, this project provides a scalable and reliable solution for managing event ticketing in a digital and automated manner.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
endobj
