/P 292 0 R
/T (Security is another important aspect of this project. The system ensures that each user has a unique login account, and all ticket data is securely stored in the database. The QR code validation prevents multiple uses of the same ticket, thereby avoiding misuse. Only authorized administrators can access event management and ticket validation features, which further improves system security.)
/E (Security is another important aspect of this project. The system ensures that each user has a unique login account, and all ticket data is securely stored in the database. The QR code validation prevents multiple uses of the same ticket, thereby avoiding misuse. Only authorized administrators can access event management and ticket validation features, which further improves system security.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
