509 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 294 0 R
/T (QR code-based systems significantly improve the speed and accuracy of ticket verification. Scanning a QR code takes only a few seconds and reduces human error. It also helps prevent the use of fake or duplicate tickets. However, some QR-based systems do not connect to a centralized database for real-time verification. In such cases, QR codes can still be misused if they are copied.)
/E (QR code-based systems significantly improve the speed and accuracy of ticket verification. Scanning a QR code takes only a few seconds and reduces human error. It also helps prevent the use of fake or duplicate tickets. However, some QR-based systems do not connect to a centralized database for real-time verification. In such cases, QR codes can still be misused if they are copied.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
510 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 294 0 R
/T (The proposed Event Ticket Booking System improves this by combining QR code scanning with real-time database validation. When a QR code is scanned, the system checks the ticket details in the database and updates its status immediately. This ensures that each ticket can be used only once, making the system more secure and reliable.)
/E (The proposed Event Ticket Booking System improves this by combining QR code scanning with real-time database validation. When a QR code is scanned, the system checks the ticket details in the database and updates its status immediately. This ensures that each ticket can be used only once, making the system more secure and reliable.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
