/E (The current ticket booking process may involve either manual or based on simple online systems that lack proper security and real-time verification. Manual systems involve physical tickets and human checking, which is slow and error-prone. Basic online systems allow users to book tickets but often fail to prevent ticket duplication and misuse. These problems create the need for a more advanced system that supports digital tickets and secure verification.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4 5]
