/E (The proposed Event Ticket Booking System aims to solve these issues by providing online ticket booking along with QR code-based ticket validation. To understand whether this system can be successfully implemented, a feasibility study is conducted. The feasibility study is divided into three main parts: technical feasibility, economic feasibility, and operational feasibility.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
519 0 obj
<<
