/P 295 0 R
/E (Technical feasibility refers to whether the required technology and technical resources are available to develop the system. The Event Ticket Booking System is developed using modern and well-established technologies such as React for the frontend, Spring Boot for the backend, and MySQL for the database. These technologies are widely used in web application development and have strong community support.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
520 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
