/P 295 0 R
/E (React helps in building a responsive and interactive user interface, while Spring Boot provides a robust framework for developing secure and scalable backend services. MySQL is a reliable database system that efficiently stores and retrieves large amounts of data. Since these technologies are open-source and easily available, there are no major technical difficulties in developing the proposed system. Therefore, the system is technically feasible.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
