/T (Payment Section The Payment Section enables users to complete ticket booking through a secure and user-friendly payment interface. After selecting the event and preferred seats, the total ticket amount is displayed along with booking details. The system supports multiple payment methods such as debit card, credit card, UPI, and net banking to provide flexibility to users. All payment transactions are processed through secure APIs to ensure data privacy and protection.)
/E (Payment Section The Payment Section enables users to complete ticket booking through a secure and user-friendly payment interface. After selecting the event and preferred seats, the total ticket amount is displayed along with booking details. The system supports multiple payment methods such as debit card, credit card, UPI, and net banking to provide flexibility to users. All payment transactions are processed through secure APIs to ensure data privacy and protection.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [5]
>>
