/T (Tickets Section The Tickets Section displays all booked tickets of the user in an organized manner. Each ticket contains important details such as event name, date, time, venue, seat numbers, booking ID, and QR code. Users can view, download, or share their tickets directly from this section. The QR code attached to each ticket is used for entry verification at the event venue. It improves user experience and supports paperless event entry through QR validation. )
/E (Tickets Section The Tickets Section displays all booked tickets of the user in an organized manner. Each ticket contains important details such as event name, date, time, venue, seat numbers, booking ID, and QR code. Users can view, download, or share their tickets directly from this section. The QR code attached to each ticket is used for entry verification at the event venue. It improves user experience and supports paperless event entry through QR validation. )
