/E (The system consists of two main modules: User Module and Admin Module. The User Module allows users to register, log in, browse events, book tickets, and view their booked tickets in the form of QR codes. The Admin Module enables administrators to add and manage events, monitor ticket bookings, and validate tickets by scanning QR codes at the event entry point.)
/Pg 11 0 R
